    <briefdescription>
<para>Uncached allocator (used as a basis for other allocators) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Any allocation/deallocation results in an actual underlying CUDA API call (e.g. cudaMallocAsync). This allocator should generally not be used directly, but used within an allocator with a more advanced strategy (caching, heap allocation, ...) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
